## Verification

TODO(content): how the system was tested — UAT, test cases, pilot (IN-05).

## Outcome

HR's overtime recap time went from about 4 hours to about 5 minutes, because the recap is now generated automatically.

## Reflection

Building a system like this meant understanding the business process, translating operational rules into system logic, designing dynamic approval workflows, and considering data security and traceability. It also reinforced a view I hold: people analytics is not only about analyzing the data that exists; it is also about improving the processes that produce that data.
